{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43197","headline":"登乐游原怀古 · 豆卢回","name":"登乐游原怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缅惟汉宣帝，初谓皇曾孙。\n虽在襁褓中，亦遭巫蛊冤。\n至哉丙廷尉，感激义弥敦。\n驰逐莲勺道，出入诸陵门。\n一朝风云会，竟登天位尊。\n握符升宝历，负扆御华轩。\n赫奕文物备，葳蕤休瑞繁。\n卒爲中兴主，垂名於後昆。\n雄图奄已谢，余址空复存。\n昔爲乐游苑，今爲狐兔园。\n朝见牧竖集，夕闻栖鸟喧。\n萧条灞亭岸，寂寞杜陵原。\n羃䍥野烟起，苍茫岚气昏。\n二曜屡回薄，四时更凉温。\n天道尚如此，人理安可论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"豆卢回","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}